csl-pp-cgo27-artifact

This artifact contains third-party code:

- src/cgo27_artifact/vendor/sdk-examples: the examples of the Cerebras SDK,
  github.com/Cerebras/sdk-examples at tag v2.10.0, unmodified. Copyright
  Cerebras Systems, Apache License, Version 2.0 (vendor/sdk-examples/LICENSE).

- src/cgo27_artifact/benchmarks/vanilla-patches: changes to seven of those
  examples, which add timestamps around the measured interval. They are
  applied to a copy at run time.

- src/cgo27_artifact/benchmarks/coro-benchmarks: the same seven benchmarks and
  the libraries they use (benchmark-libs), written with the language
  extensions of csl++. They are derived from the examples above and from the
  libraries of the Cerebras SDK.

- src/cgo27_artifact/vendor/simtracer: the trace tool
  github.com/esa-tu-darmstadt/cerebras-simtracer at the commit in
  vendor/simtracer/COMMIT, MIT License (vendor/simtracer/LICENSE).

Everything else is under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions
(LICENSE.TXT).
